# ── Rust build artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────
/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
*.profraw

# ── Packaging output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
/build/
*.AppImage
*.deb
*.flatpak
# Per-build manifest files cargo-deb emits next to .deb
*.changes
*.buildinfo

# ── IDE / Editor files ───────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
*.bak
.#*
\#*\#
.netrwhist
# rust-analyzer
.rust-analyzer/

# ── AI assistant / agent artifacts ───────────────────────────────────
# Per-developer agent config, memory, and session state. Lives next to
# the repo for convenience but is not project history — each contributor
# has their own.
.claude/
.aider*
.cursor/
.continue/
CLAUDE.local.md

# ── Atomic-write leftovers ───────────────────────────────────────────
# util::atomic_write_bytes uses this suffix; a crash mid-write can
# strand one of these next to a target file.
*.anima.tmp

# ── Crash recovery / config backups produced by anima-engine ─────────
# These live under ~/.config/animaEngine but show up here if someone
# runs the binary from the source tree.
*.toml.bak
crash-recovery.toml

# ── Environment / secrets ────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.local
.envrc

# ── Logs / coredumps ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
core
core.*

# ── Demo assets (generated procedurally at first run) ────────────────
# Committed to make `git clone && cargo run` show characters
# immediately. Uncomment if you'd rather regenerate them locally.
# assets/demo/

# ── OS-specific junk ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
